### Create first event user 1!

POST localhost:3000/create_event
Host: localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: */*

{
  "user_id" : 1,
  "date" : "2024-12-14",
  "description" : "WB Rust course deadline, was two month ago prev year"
}

### Get it

GET localhost:3000/events_for_day?user_id=1&date=2024-12-14  HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: */*

### Create second event for user 1 same date!

POST localhost:3000/create_event
Host: localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: */*

{
  "user_id" : 1,
  "date" : "2024-12-14",
  "description" : "Second event"
}

###

POST localhost:3000/update_event
Host: localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: */*

{
  "user_id" : 1,
  "event_id" : 0,
  "date" : "2024-12-14",
  "description" : "Дедлайн и дедлайн, чего бубнить-то"
}

### Delete evente

POST localhost:3000/delete_event
Host: localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: */*

{
  "user_id" : 1,
  "date" : "2024-12-14",
  "remove_event_id" : 0
}